<div class="customer-reviews-section section section--{{ section.settings.section_width }}" style="--customer-reviews-bg-image: url('{{ "review_bg.webp" | asset_url }}');">
  <div class="customer-reviews__inner">
    <div class="customer-reviews__header">
      <p class="customer-reviews__eyebrow">CUSTOMER LOVE</p>
      <h2 class="customer-reviews__heading">Customers Are Saying</h2>
      <p class="customer-reviews__rating" aria-label="4.8 out of 5 from 500 plus happy customers">
        <span class="customer-reviews__stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span>
        <span class="customer-reviews__rating-text">4.8/5 from 500+ happy customers</span>
      </p>
      <p class="customer-reviews__subheading">
        Real reviews from real customers who love our personalized bedding.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="customer-reviews__grid">
      <article class="customer-reviews__card">
        <div class="customer-reviews__person">
          <div class="customer-reviews__avatar customer-reviews__avatar--jessica customer-reviews__avatar--photo" aria-hidden="true">
            <img
              src="{{ 'customer-jessica-avatar.webp' | asset_url }}"
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
              width="80"
              height="80"
            >
          </div>
          <div class="customer-reviews__meta">
            <h3 class="customer-reviews__name">Jessica M.</h3>
            <p class="customer-reviews__verified">Verified Buyer</p>
            <p class="customer-reviews__card-stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="customer-reviews__body">
          I bought this America 250 quilt for my own bedroom, and it instantly made the space feel
          warmer and more meaningful. The patriotic design looks beautiful in person, the colors feel
          rich without being too loud, and the quilt is soft, cozy, and very well made.
        </p>
        <div class="customer-reviews__product">
          <div class="customer-reviews__product-thumb customer-reviews__product-thumb--patchwork customer-reviews__product-image--photo" aria-hidden="true">
            <img
              src="{{ 'review-jessica-america-250-quilt.webp' | asset_url }}"
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
              width="96"
              height="96"
            >
          </div>
          <div class="customer-reviews__product-copy">
            <p class="customer-reviews__product-title">America 250 Freedom Quilt</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="customer-reviews__card">
        <div class="customer-reviews__person">
          <div class="customer-reviews__avatar customer-reviews__avatar--amanda customer-reviews__avatar--photo" aria-hidden="true">
            <img
              src="{{ 'customer-amanda-avatar.webp' | asset_url }}"
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
              width="80"
              height="80"
            >
          </div>
          <div class="customer-reviews__meta">
            <h3 class="customer-reviews__name">Amanda R.</h3>
            <p class="customer-reviews__verified">Verified Buyer</p>
            <p class="customer-reviews__card-stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="customer-reviews__body">
          I ordered this reading blanket for my daughter, and it turned out even more beautiful than I
          expected. She absolutely loves books, so the design felt perfect for her, and seeing her name
          on it made it even more special. The blanket is soft, cozy, and looks so lovely draped on her bed.
        </p>
        <div class="customer-reviews__product">
          <div class="customer-reviews__product-thumb customer-reviews__product-thumb--photo">
            <img
              src="{{ 'customer-amanda-reading-blanket.webp' | asset_url }}"
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
              width="96"
              height="96"
            >
          </div>
          <div class="customer-reviews__product-copy">
            <p class="customer-reviews__product-title">Personalized Reading Blanket</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="customer-reviews__card">
        <div class="customer-reviews__person">
          <div class="customer-reviews__avatar customer-reviews__avatar--rachel customer-reviews__avatar--photo" aria-hidden="true">
            <img
              src="{{ 'customer-rachel-avatar.webp' | asset_url }}"
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
              width="80"
              height="80"
            >
          </div>
          <div class="customer-reviews__meta">
            <h3 class="customer-reviews__name">Rachel T.</h3>
            <p class="customer-reviews__verified">Verified Buyer</p>
            <p class="customer-reviews__card-stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="customer-reviews__body">
          I got this Christmas blanket for my two daughters, and they were so excited the moment they
          saw it. The design feels festive and personal, and having both of their names on it made it
          even more special. It's soft, cozy, and has already become their favorite blanket for movie
          nights during the holiday season.
        </p>
        <div class="customer-reviews__product">
          <div class="customer-reviews__product-thumb customer-reviews__product-thumb--photo">
            <img
              src="{{ 'customer-rachel-christmas-blanket.webp' | asset_url }}"
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
              width="96"
              height="96"
            >
          </div>
          <div class="customer-reviews__product-copy">
            <p class="customer-reviews__product-title">Personalized Christmas Blanket</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="customer-reviews__card">
        <div class="customer-reviews__person">
          <div class="customer-reviews__avatar customer-reviews__avatar--sarah customer-reviews__avatar--photo" aria-hidden="true">
            <img
              src="{{ 'customer-sarah-avatar.webp' | asset_url }}"
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
              width="80"
              height="80"
            >
          </div>
          <div class="customer-reviews__meta">
            <h3 class="customer-reviews__name">Sarah L.</h3>
            <p class="customer-reviews__verified">Verified Buyer</p>
            <p class="customer-reviews__card-stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="customer-reviews__body">
          I bought this cat quilt set to make the room feel a little warmer and more inviting, and it
          turned out even better than I expected. The colors are rich, the artwork is beautiful, and
          the whole set feels soft, cozy, and well made. It adds such a charming personality to the space.
        </p>
        <div class="customer-reviews__product">
          <div class="customer-reviews__product-thumb customer-reviews__product-thumb--photo">
            <img
              src="{{ 'customer-sarah-cat-quilt.webp' | asset_url }}"
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
              width="96"
              height="96"
            >
          </div>
          <div class="customer-reviews__product-copy">
            <p class="customer-reviews__product-title">Cat Quilt Set</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .customer-reviews-section {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    padding-block: clamp(2.4rem, 4.8vw, 3.5rem);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .customer-reviews-section::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -2;
    pointer-events: none;
    background-color: #f6efe8;
    background-image: var(--customer-reviews-bg-image, none);
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
  }

  .customer-reviews-section::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: rgb(255 248 239 / 0.12);
  }

  .customer-reviews__inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: min(100%, 1200px);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
  }

  .customer-reviews__header {
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0 auto clamp(1.35rem, 2.8vw, 2rem);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .customer-reviews__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
    color: #9d6c4f;
    font-size: clamp(0.74rem, 0.92vw, 0.86rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  }

  .customer-reviews__heading {
    margin: 0;
    color: #3f2e24;
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.1vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .customer-reviews__rating {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin: 0.7rem 0 0;
    color: #5a4030;
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.15vw, 1rem);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .customer-reviews__stars,
  .customer-reviews__card-stars {
    color: #b87345;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .customer-reviews__subheading {
    margin: 0.65rem auto 0;
    max-width: 31rem;
    color: #6f594a;
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1vw, 0.98rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .customer-reviews__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(0.7rem, 1.1vw, 0.9rem);
  }

  .customer-reviews__card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: clamp(0.8rem, 1.1vw, 0.95rem);
    border: 1px solid rgb(214 187 163 / 0.7);
    border-radius: 1.6rem;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(255 250 245 / 0.8) 0%, rgb(249 240 231 / 0.9) 100%);
    box-shadow:
      0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255 / 0.65) inset,
      0 14px 28px rgb(110 80 61 / 0.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
  }

  .customer-reviews__person {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .customer-reviews__avatar {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 3.3rem;
    height: 3.3rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: #fff9f4;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.55), transparent 30%), linear-gradient(135deg, #d4ae95, #8a6248);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgb(95 70 53 / 0.14);
  }

  .customer-reviews__avatar--photo {
    overflow: hidden;
    background: none;
  }

  .customer-reviews__avatar--photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .customer-reviews__avatar--amanda {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.55), transparent 30%), linear-gradient(135deg, #c9967b, #6c4a36);
  }

  .customer-reviews__avatar--rachel {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.55), transparent 30%), linear-gradient(135deg, #d2a48c, #7f5841);
  }

  .customer-reviews__avatar--sarah {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.55), transparent 30%), linear-gradient(135deg, #d8b395, #8e6448);
  }

  .customer-reviews__name {
    margin: 0;
    color: #4d382a;
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-size: clamp(1.12rem, 1.3vw, 1.35rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .customer-reviews__verified {
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0;
    color: #7d6657;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .customer-reviews__card-stars {
    margin: 0.28rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
  }

  .customer-reviews__body {
    margin: 0;
    color: #5f493a;
    font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 0.82vw, 0.84rem);
    line-height: 1.38;
  }

  .customer-reviews__product {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding: 0.45rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(220 199 180 / 0.72);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: rgb(255 247 239 / 0.58);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255 / 0.55) inset;
  }

  .customer-reviews__product-thumb {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 2.85rem;
    height: 2.85rem;
    border-radius: 0.85rem;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgb(82 58 44 / 0.08);
  }

  .customer-reviews__product-image--photo {
    overflow: hidden;
    background: none;
  }

  .customer-reviews__product-image--photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .customer-reviews__product-thumb--photo {
    overflow: hidden;
    background: none;
  }

  .customer-reviews__product-thumb--photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .customer-reviews__product-thumb--patchwork {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d9b38e, #8c5e41 60%, #4d3326);
  }

  .customer-reviews__product-thumb--duvet {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f1e3d5, #d7c0ab 55%, #b79273);
  }

  .customer-reviews__product-thumb--blanket {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4a3a7, #bb8a90 52%, #8f6167);
  }

  .customer-reviews__product-thumb--comforter {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dfc4af, #bf9b80 52%, #8c6349);
  }

  .customer-reviews__product-title,
  .customer-reviews__product-meta {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .customer-reviews__product-title {
    color: #584233;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.22;
  }

  .customer-reviews__product-meta {
    margin-top: 0.12rem;
    color: #8d7768;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.22;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 1199px) {
    .customer-reviews__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .customer-reviews__card {
      gap: 0.8rem;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .customer-reviews-section {
      padding-block: 2.1rem;
    }

    .customer-reviews__grid {
      display: flex;
      overflow-x: auto;
      gap: 0.9rem;
      padding-inline: 1rem;
      padding-block-end: 0.5rem;
      margin-inline: -1rem;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      scroll-padding-inline: 1rem;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }

    .customer-reviews__grid::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }

    .customer-reviews__card {
      flex: 0 0 min(84vw, 22rem);
      scroll-snap-align: start;
    }

    .customer-reviews__person {
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .customer-reviews__avatar {
      width: 3.75rem;
      height: 3.75rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .customer-reviews__name {
      font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 6vw, 1.55rem);
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
  {
    "name": "Customer reviews",
    "settings": [
      {
        "type": "select",
        "id": "section_width",
        "label": "Section width",
        "default": "page-width",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "page-width",
            "label": "Page width"
          }, {
            "value": "full-width",
            "label": "Full width"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "presets": [
      {
        "name": "Customer reviews"
      }
    ]
  }
{% endschema %}




